msgid "Market Split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "Problema Market Split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Table 1 shows specific performance metrics for the Parity Twine Optimizer applied to various instances of the Market Split (MS) problem.\n"
"These were obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) and correspond to\n"
"[submissions](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) made to the\n"
"library using the Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tabelul 1 prezintă metrici specifice de performanță pentru Parity Twine Optimizer, aplicat unor instanțe diverse ale problemei Market Split (MS).\n"
"Acestea au fost obținute din [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) și corespund unor\n"
"[trimiteri](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) făcute către\n"
"bibliotecă utilizând Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MS violation is an accuracy metric that measures how far the solution is from satisfying all constraints, defined as $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Lower values of this metric indicate more accurate solutions.\n"
"Table 1 reports averaged values for five runs of each instance using the Parity Twine Optimizer with the `ibm_boston` device as a backend and 100,000 shots.\n"
"The minimum MS violation obtained from the runs of each instance is reported.\n"
msgstr ""
"Încălcarea MS (MS violation) este o metrică de acuratețe care măsoară cât de departe este soluția de a satisface toate constrângerile, definită ca $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Valori mai mici ale acestei metrici indică soluții mai precise.\n"
"Tabelul 1 raportează valori medii pentru cinci rulări ale fiecărei instanțe, utilizând Parity Twine Optimizer cu dispozitivul `ibm_boston` ca backend și 100.000 de shot-uri.\n"
"Se raportează încălcarea minimă MS obținută din rulările fiecărei instanțe.\n"

